    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here is the translation of the updated text:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a casual puzzle game that combines mathematical calculations and basic elimination gameplay. In the game, you can slide the mouse to determine the movement direction of all &quot;blocks,&quot; and through repeated decisions, gradually strengthen the &quot;Blue Legion&quot; to ultimately defeat the evil &quot;Red Legion.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Instructions:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide the mouse to control the movement of all blocks.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429970/extras/7b89278f49428aaf5194fe8c545bb63a.poster.avif?t=1742901706\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429970/extras/7b89278f49428aaf5194fe8c545bb63a.webm?t=1742901706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blocks of the same color and value can merge to strengthen the legion\u2019s power!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429970/extras/c11cfa8ca7712e187c299f74565352e0.poster.avif?t=1742901706\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429970/extras/c11cfa8ca7712e187c299f74565352e0.webm?t=1742901706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a block's value is greater than or equal to the enemy\u2019s, it can &quot;eat&quot; the enemy and generate a new block.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429970/extras/ebfebec640f060fed609952d04da9988.poster.avif?t=1742901706\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429970/extras/ebfebec640f060fed609952d04da9988.webm?t=1742901706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your Blue Legion and achieve victory!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429970/extras/5a45f5b4f4838b6e1bc1e3e1311ae524.poster.avif?t=1742901706\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429970/extras/5a45f5b4f4838b6e1bc1e3e1311ae524.webm?t=1742901706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429970/extras/5a45f5b4f4838b6e1bc1e3e1311ae524.mp4?t=1742901706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here is the translation of the updated text:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a casual puzzle game that combines mathematical calculations and basic elimination gameplay. In the game, you can slide the mouse to determine the movement direction of all &quot;blocks,&quot; and through repeated decisions, gradually strengthen the &quot;Blue Legion&quot; to ultimately defeat the evil &quot;Red Legion.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Instructions:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide the mouse to control the movement of all blocks.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429970/extras/7b89278f49428aaf5194fe8c545bb63a.poster.avif?t=1742901706\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429970/extras/7b89278f49428aaf5194fe8c545bb63a.webm?t=1742901706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blocks of the same color and value can merge to strengthen the legion\u2019s power!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429970/extras/c11cfa8ca7712e187c299f74565352e0.poster.avif?t=1742901706\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429970/extras/c11cfa8ca7712e187c299f74565352e0.webm?t=1742901706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a block's value is greater than or equal to the enemy\u2019s, it can &quot;eat&quot; the enemy and generate a new block.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429970/extras/ebfebec640f060fed609952d04da9988.poster.avif?t=1742901706\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429970/extras/ebfebec640f060fed609952d04da9988.webm?t=1742901706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your Blue Legion and achieve victory!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429970/extras/5a45f5b4f4838b6e1bc1e3e1311ae524.poster.avif?t=1742901706\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429970/extras/5a45f5b4f4838b6e1bc1e3e1311ae524.webm?t=1742901706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429970/extras/5a45f5b4f4838b6e1bc1e3e1311ae524.mp4?t=1742901706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "This is a casual game that combines math and basic elimination gameplay. If you're confident in your math skills, give it a try! In the game, you'll decide the direction of all the &quot;blocks&quot; and gradually strengthen the &quot;Blue Legion&quot; to defeat the evil &quot;Red Legion.&quot;",
